managePosition.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── given the module is suspended
   │  └── it should revert with Suspended
   └── given the module is not suspended
      ├── given the module is paused
      │  └── it should revert with Paused
      └── given the module is not paused
         ├── when caller is not a registered operator
         │  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
         └── when caller is a registered operator
            ├── when the management instruction position ID is zero
            │  └── it should revert with ZeroPositionId
            └── when the management instruction position ID is not zero
               ├── when the management instruction is not of the management type
               │  └── it should revert with InvalidInstructionType
               └── when the management instruction is of the management type
                  ├── when the management instruction proof is not valid against the merkle root set in the module
                  │  └── it should revert with InvalidInstructionProof
                  └── when the management instruction proof is valid against the merkle root set in the module
                     ├── when no accounting instruction is provided
                     │  ├── given operating mode is Walled
                     │  │  └── it should revert with AccountingMandatory
                     │  └── given operating mode is Open or Fenced
                     │     ├── given the management instruction execution fails
                     │     │  └── it should revert
                     │     └── given the management instruction execution succeeds
                     │        ├── it should emit a PositionManaged event with a zero position value
                     │        └── it should return a zero position value and value change
                     └── when an accounting instruction is provided
                        ├── when the 2 instructions position IDs or isDebt flags do not match
                        │  └── it should revert with InstructionsMismatch
                        └── when the 2 instructions position IDs and isDebt flags match
                           ├── when the accounting instruction is not of the accounting type
                           │  └── it should revert with InvalidInstructionType
                           └── when the accounting instruction is of the accounting type
                              ├── when the accounting instruction proof is not valid against the merkle root set in the module
                              │  └── it should revert with InvalidInstructionProof
                              └── when the accounting instruction proof is valid against the merkle root set in the module
                                 ├── given the accounting instruction execution fails
                                 │  └── it should revert
                                 └── given the accounting instruction execution succeeds
                                    ├── given the accounting instruction does not output a valid state
                                    │  └── it should revert with InvalidAccounting
                                    └── given the accounting instruction outputs a valid state
                                       ├── given price data is not registered for one of the accounting instruction's affected tokens
                                       │  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
                                       └── given price data is registered for all the accounting instruction's affected tokens
                                          ├── given the management instruction execution fails
                                          │  └── it should revert
                                          └── given the management instruction execution succeeds
                                             ├── given operating mode is Open or Fenced
                                             │  ├── it should value the position in the accounting currency
                                             │  ├── it should emit a PositionManaged event with the new position value
                                             │  └── it should return the new position value and the value change resulting from management
                                             └── given operating mode is Walled
                                                ├── given there is an ongoing cooldown for the executed commands
                                                │  └── it should revert with OngoingCooldown
                                                └── given there is no ongoing cooldown for the executed commands
                                                   ├── given the module's safe globally spends affected tokens and the position value moves in the wrong direction
                                                   │  └── it should revert with InvalidPositionChangeDirection
                                                   └── given the module's safe globally receives affected tokens or the position value moves in the expected direction
                                                      ├── given the position value increased
                                                      │  ├── given the relative value loss is greater than maxPositionIncreaseLossBps
                                                      │  │  └── it should revert with MaxValueLossExceeded
                                                      │  └── given the relative value loss is not greater than maxPositionIncreaseLossBps
                                                      │     ├── it should value the position in the accounting currency
                                                      │     ├── it should emit a PositionManaged event with the new position value
                                                      │     └── it should return the new position value and the value change resulting from management
                                                      └── given the position value did not increase
                                                         ├── given the relative value loss is greater than maxPositionDecreaseLossBps
                                                         │  └── it should revert with MaxValueLossExceeded
                                                         └── given the relative value loss is not greater than maxPositionDecreaseLossBps
                                                            ├── it should value the position in the accounting currency
                                                            ├── it should emit a PositionManaged event with the new position value
                                                            └── it should return the new position value and the value change resulting from management
